- the technological and industrial sophistication of societies;
- the productivity and wealth accumulation of societies;
- the ability of citizens to. participate in decision making which affects their well-being;
- the standard of living;
- . the ability of societies to influence the decision making of other societies;
- the consumption levels of societies; and
- . the society's impact on the environment.

